        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Todemarae Ŋisirael Asaduku a Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋul, kepotu Ŋisirael toloto akitijiore Ŋipilistin. Kebu ajore a Ŋisirael kiboikin epeiwae neni enyaritae Ebenesa, kiboikin ajore a Ŋipilistin neni enyaritae Apek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisicodosi Ŋipilistin ajore kec akisiiryakin Ŋisirael, ani iryamete ŋajorei ejikin, apotu Ŋipilistin toreut Ŋisirael, toara alokiryam ŋikilyok ŋulu aapikinit ekimar kec ŋalipyo ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eboŋunete ŋajorei a Ŋisirael neni sek eboikino ikes, temasi ŋikasikou a ŋisirael ebe, “Kaanukiro emyekinia Ekapolon Ŋipilistin ikilounete iwon nakoloŋit na? Apena oyautu alo Silo Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ke Ekapolon, ikotere ebuni Ekapolon kidiŋ yok itoiu iwon anagogoŋu a ŋimoe yok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, aponi kiyakiyarae ŋituŋa Silo, yaut ŋul alo Silo Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ke Ekapolon a ŋolo Etiron, a ŋolo anupito Ŋisirael atemar eyai kidiŋ ŋitorubei ŋulu a Ŋisubuna a ŋulu eya ŋabebenuk a ŋulu aya Nasaduku. Ayakasi apaki ŋin ŋidwe ke Eli ŋulusapa, Opini ka Pineas, neni ayai Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edolunere Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet a Ekapolon neni eboiyoto Ŋisirael, tocelut Ŋisirael daadaŋ nooi, kituruturokin akwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete Ŋipilistin ecelet ŋol, temasi, “Nyo apolou a ecelet a ŋol, a ŋolo ecelasi Ŋiburaniyae?” Ani nai eyenunete ikes atemar keyaun Asaduku ŋina ke Ekapolon neni eboiyoto Ŋisirael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tokuryaketa Ŋipilistin; anerae apotu ikes temasi, “Apotu ŋakujo neni iboiyoto Ŋisirael.” Temasi nabo ikes, “Okoe ikiloma iwon locan! Nyetakanuna ŋakiro ŋuna ikote nu ŋinapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woitakoi! Ŋae ikilakuni iwon anakan a ŋakujo a nu a ŋuna agogoŋok? Erae ikes ŋakujo ŋunakoloŋ apotu toara Ŋijipitian analoŋisat a ŋidekesyo a ŋulugelegelya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totitinyokiata, iyes Ŋipilistin, ikotere nyikiruwor ŋipi a Ŋiburaniyae lopite ŋolo sek araakatar ikes ŋipi yok. Toruworos ŋikilyok ŋulu ititiny, ido tojioto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Ŋipilistin kitijioto Ŋisirael toreut. Tobwaŋas Ŋisirael, toem ŋinituŋanan lore keŋ. Totwaka Ŋisirael ŋulu alalak nooi ŋulu alosete a ŋakejen ŋulu adolit ekimar kec ŋalipyo ŋatomoniuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todemarae Ŋisirael Asaduku ŋina ka Akuj, toarae daŋ ŋidwe ke Eli ŋulusapa ŋuluarei, Opini ka Pineas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Eli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, kebu ekile epei ŋolo a ekabila a Benjamin, toem alojie, tolot Silo, todol iŋes Silo ekoris ŋilowi ka ileleba apuwa nakou. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina adolio iŋes nen, eboi Eli alokicoloŋ keŋ alodiyete erot eteorit lowae ŋolo a Misipa, anerae kebu etau keŋ tomaran aŋuna ka Asaduku a ŋina ka Akuj. Ani elomuni ekile ŋol lotaun, tolimo ŋakiro a ejie, kikalou etaun daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari Eli ŋituŋa igworosi, tema, “Anikiolol na?” Bu nai ekile ŋol atipei neni ke Eli tolimok Eli ŋakiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, arae Eli ŋikaru ŋatomonikanikaomwon ka ŋikanikauni, ido aris ŋakonyen keŋ kemumu, pa apedorit iŋes akitere ejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema ekile ŋol neni ke Eli, “Adolun ayoŋ napei na alojie, amotun ayoŋ alojie akoloŋit napei na.” Kiŋit Eli iŋes tema, “Abu ejie tolot ikwaani ikoku kaŋ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok ekayaunan ŋakiro ŋol tema, “Asurosi Ŋisirael alokiŋaren Ŋipilistin, ido etwakito ŋituŋa ŋulu alalak anajorei yok; aari tari ŋidwe kon ŋulusapa ŋuluarei Opini ka Pineas. Ademar Ŋisirael Asaduku ŋina ka Akuj.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elimuni iŋes Asaduku ŋina ka Akuj, kimasar Eli ekaukau, alokicoloŋ keŋ a ŋolo eboiyo iŋes kimasakin diyete epuke, tobila emosiriŋ keŋ, totwana Eli, anerae aris iŋes kemojoŋ, ido ayai apotis nakuwan keŋ. Keris iŋes kitiya erae ekatubon ŋakiro alo Isirael ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, kepoti nateran keŋ, aberu a Pineas, kedolit akidoun. Ani iirari iŋes atemar ademar Ŋisirael Asaduku ŋina ka Akuj, ido atwaka papa alokile keŋ ka lokile keŋ, abu iŋes kijuuru toryedik, kidou; anerae abu aryeba ŋina ka akidoun kilopiya iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iŋolikini akesidounon keŋ atemar elosi aberu ŋin akiridakin, tolimok akesidounon iŋes tema, “Nyikuryaniar, anerae idou iyoŋ isapat.” Nai abu iŋes nyeboŋok ŋun, kori nyemitak akiirar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok iŋes ekiro a ikoku Icabod, apolou a ekiro a ŋol iŋes na ebe, “Alot apolou ŋina ka Akuj aneni a Ŋisirael,” anerae ademar ikes Asaduku ŋina ka Akuj ka atwaka papa alokile keŋ ka lokile keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu iŋes tema, “Alot apolou ŋina ka Akuj aneni a Ŋisirael, anerae ademar ikes Asaduku ŋina ka Akuj.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
